9:- **R-003 | Fixed terminology** — «живой ход» = full «player sent replica» → «world answered» loop (Telegram bridge → facade :8000 → turn conveyor → answer); «мастерская» = background loop (pauses/night, ковка); «банк» = ready artifacts in DB (subtypes рутина/драма); «ковка» = model processing of an artifact with DB save; «дайджест» = player summary only, мастерская summary = «сводка»; word «бой» banned; subsystem names kept as code-names. Source: TNS65-PARADIGM.md:5. Status: CANON.
