126:- **R-117 | 09 one-glance tables** — 21-item table (name/contour/one-liner per p.N); three rules verbatim; roles table; three-DB table; common-errors table («бой» banned; вектор судьбы ≠ вектор смысла; заявка ≠ plan; дайджест = player only; Пила advises Селектор decides; owner not in loop; 10-min pause = no prose; рутина never оседает; Паганель never writes literary.db; Hermes never downloads models; mysticism = `mystic` tag not censorship; порог смерти 2% = working value not canon; «варка» = historical synonym of «ковка»). Source: DOCS/09-QUICK-REFERENCE.md:7–90. Status: PLAN.
